The class builds on ctexart. ctex, siunitx, pgfplots and the other packages
the sample loads, and the Fandol fonts, are not part of this template; they
come from the TeX distribution (the built-in Tectonic bundle) under their
own licenses. The school name in the sample is an example field value.
